 <HI REND="ITALIC">quae mundus</HI></P> <P COM="0424"><COL N="0424"></COL> 7 Ed. Schot.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">idem opifex.</HI></P> <P COM="0424"><COL N="0424"></COL> 8 Ms. Regius codex,  <HI REND="ITALIC">molem infusam atque permixtam.</HI></P> <P COM="0424"><COL N="0424"></COL> 9 Ed. Schot.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et condidit.</HI></P> <P COM="0424"><COL N="0424"></COL> 10 Ex Virgilio. ms. Vatic. et ed. Grin.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">sopitam,</HI>  mendose.</P> <P COM="0424"><COL N="0424"></COL> 11 Ms. Reg. cum edd. 4.  <HI REND="ITALIC">nomina quaeque sint.</HI></P> <P COM="0424"><COL N="0424"></COL> 12 Ita mss. Vatic. et Vien. Alias,  <HI REND="ITALIC">curis prudentiae,</HI>  
etc.</P> <P COM="0424"><COL N="0424"></COL> 13 Sic ms. Vien. Abest quoque particula  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  in ms.
