copia,</HI>  vera lectio quam tuentur mss. codices et tres
editi. Vide not. 51, 61.</P> <P COM="0425"><COL N="0425"></COL> 22 Addidimus  <HI REND="ITALIC">est</HI>  ex ms. codice Viennensi.</P> <P COM="0425"><COL N="0425"></COL> 23 Ms. codex Vien.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Omitte.</HI></P> <P COM="0425"><COL N="0425"></COL> 24 Ms. Reg.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">adsumtos.</HI>  Edd. Bad. et Grav.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">assumptos.</HI></P> <P COM="0425"><COL N="0425"></COL> 25 Ms. Vien.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">phantasmatibus.</HI></P> <P COM="0425"><COL N="0425"></COL> 26 Ms. Reg.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">decepit.</HI></P></DIV1> <COL N="0425"></COL> <DIV1 SECOND=YES COM="0425"><HEAD COM="0425">IN EPIST. XVII.</HEAD> <P COM="0425"><COL N="0425"></COL> 1 Ita ms. codex Regius. Editi,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Severo fratri unanimo,
