 <HI REND="ITALIC">ipsos.</HI></NOTE> ,</L> <L N=510>Dum loquerentur, erat monti conjuncta Vesevo <NOTE N="(t)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0540" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0540D"></COL> In Mur. codice legitur  <HI REND="ITALIC">Besaevo.</HI>  At noster habet
