 <HI REND="ITALIC">idem stylus I efficit tau.</HI>  MURATORIUS.</NOTE>  idem stylus ipse brevi retro acumine <NOTE N="(f)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0546" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0546B"></COL> Muratorii codex habet:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Tau idem stylus ipse
brevi retro a cacumine ductus.</HI>  Noster vero codex:
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Taut idem stylus ipse retro acumine ductus.</HI>  Utraque
