 <HI REND="ITALIC">rex Gothorum agmine ingenti et immani jam in Urbis
vicinia constitutus, Romanis cervicibus immineret.</HI>  MURATORIUS.</NOTE>  ipsis jam faucibus urbis</L> <L>Pellere, et exitium, seu vincula vertere in ipsos,</L> <L><COL N="0571B"></COL> Qui minitabantur <NOTE N="(f)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0571" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0571D"></COL> Paulino adstipulatur Orosius supra laudatus:
 <COL N="0571D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Qui</HI>  (Rhadagaisus),  <HI REND="ITALIC">ut mos est barbaris gentibus, omnem
