 <HI REND="ITALIC">locutum.</HI></NOTE> ,</L> <L><COL N="0573A"></COL> Unde nihil proprium meritis Felicis adesset:</L> <L>Nec reticere tamen potui, quia portio laudis</L> <L N=40>Hinc <NOTE N="(a)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0573" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0573B"></COL> Emendavi ex nostro codice. Mur. habet  <HI REND="ITALIC">hoc</HI>  
