Therasiae,</HI>  *XXXI, 32; *XCXV, 269.</P> <P COM="1095"><HI REND="ITALIC">Celanciae, in Append.,</HI>  727.</P> <P COM="1095">Delphino, X, 46; XIV, 82; XIX, 104; XX, 107; XXXV, 219.</P> <P COM="1095">Desiderio, XLIV, 257.</P> <P COM="1095"><COL N="1095C"></COL> Eucherio et Gallae, LI, 313.</P> <P COM="1095">Florentio, XLII, 250.</P> <P COM="1095"><COL N="1096B"></COL> Gallae, LI, 313.</P> <P COM="1096">Jovio, XVI, 87.</P> <P COM="1096">Licentio, VIII, 37.</P> <P COM="1096">Macario, XLIX, 277.</P> <P COM="1096"><HI REND="ITALIC">Marcellae, in Append.</HI>  I, 721.</P> <P COM="1096">Militi cuidam, XXV, 162.</P> <P COM="1096">Pammachio, XIII, 65.</P> <P COM="1096">Romaniano, VII, 36.</P> <P COM="1096">Ruffino, XLVI, 274; XLVII, 275.</P> <P COM="1096">Sancto et Amando, XL, 238; XLI, 248.</P> <P COM="1096">Sebastiano eremitae, XXVI, 166.</P> <P COM="1096">Severo, I, 1; v. 20; XI, 48; XVII, 94; XXII, 115; XXIII, 117;
