attributis ad humilitatem utitur, E. 20, 21, 245.</P> <P COM="1128">Lazari et Epulonis evangelici antitheses, P. 683.</P> <P COM="1128"><HI REND="ITALIC">Lengo,</HI>  oppidum e dominio Paulini, A. 886, V. 4.</P> <P COM="1128">Lex evangelica veteris legis tenebras discussit, P. 678,
