P. 468.</P> <P COM="1140">Protector, quis? E. 166, A 898, 899.</P> <P COM="1140">Protoplastae Adam et Eva, E. 123, A. 890. In Paradiso
tandiu habuerunt oculos Deo illuminatos, quandiu peccato
clausos, E. 186, 187.</P> <P COM="1140"><COL N="1141"></COL> Providentiae divinae cuncta subjacent, E. 87  <HI REND="ITALIC">et seqq.,</HI>  P.
